## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
coverage*.json
coverage*.xml
coverage*.info

## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
## Android Platform Tools — download these yourself.
## Google distributes them under its own terms; they are not redistributed here.
## Ignore the contents (so adb.exe and friends never get committed) but keep the README.
## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
platform-tools/*
!platform-tools/README.txt

## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
## APKs — never commit these.
## Home on Fire and Projectivy Launcher belong to their own projects, and their
## redistribution terms are not ours to assume.
## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
apks/*.apk
*.apk

## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
## Runtime output written beside the executable
## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
backups/
logs/
*.log

## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
## Generated from assets/icon.png at build time. Committed for convenience, so
## this entry stays commented out; uncomment if you would rather always derive it.
## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# assets/icon.ico

